{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>It is holy to the priest.</b> The חַלָּה and the רָקִיק and the זְּרוֹעַ are terumah to the priest." "<b>Upon the breast of the waving.</b> In addition to the breast and thigh that are due to him from every shelamim offering, this זְרוֹעַ is added upon the shelamim of the nazirite — because the shelamim of the nazirite were included in the general rule, and they went forth to be judged by the new matter — the separation of the זְרוֹעַ — it was necessary to bring them back into their inclusion to judge also concerning the breast and thigh (Sifrei)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:42.675460476Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}